ghlight\uc2  in part to smooth out volatility.\par \par \uc2 Write to Robert Kozak at robert.kozak@dowjones.com [ 02-07-13 1908GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130702e972000nu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
