\par\par \b \uc2 DJ  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  to Keep  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  to Buy U.S. Dollars as Needed\b0\par\par\uc2 By Robert Kozak  \par \uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2013\par 19:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \par \par \uc2 \f2 LIMA, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Peru\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 --The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Central Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Peru\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will keep \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as long as necessary to buy as many U.S. dollars as needed, aiming to avoid any extreme volatility in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's chief economist said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 Adrian Armas said Friday in a conference call with reporters that accumulating U.S. dollars will help prepare Peru in the case of any future capital outflows.\par \par \uc2 Peru attracted large amounts of capital last year, leading the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase $13.2 billion in its attempt to moderate the appreciation of the sol. So far this year the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought another net $420 million in its daily purchases.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no problem in continuing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars. It is accumulating foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and it is prepared to keep accumulating," Mr. Armas said.\par \par \uc2 The sol gained about 5.4% against the U.S. dollar last year.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Armas said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't have any target for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol.\par \par \uc2 "There is no floor or ceiling," he added.\par \par \uc2 He said that the value of the sol going forward will depend largely on external factors.\par \par \uc2 "The exchange rate is a variable that is difficult to forecast," he added.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Armas said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no plans at present to introduce any \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls, although he says the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in principle doesn't rule out using any measures.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been more recently increasing commercial bank reserve requirements, especially in U.S. dollars, aiming to limit credit growth.\par \par \uc2 Write to Robert Kozak at robert.kozak@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 11, 2013 13:19 ET (18:19 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130111e91b004tn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
