\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Stronger\b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2012\par 22:15\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA, Peru--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Monday, as shares of mining companies closed mixed.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's General Index lost 0.29% to finish at 21349.18, and the blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.23% lower at 31437.91.\par \par \uc2 Precious-metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN, BUENAVC1.VL) declined 1.35% to close at $36.60.\par \par \uc2 Buenaventura said Monday that contractor workers at its Orcopampa gold mine suspended a strike.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, base metals mining company \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO) rose 0.57% to finish at $35.20, while silver and lead miner \uc2 Volcan Compania Minera\uc2  SAA (VOLCABC1.VL) closed 1.81% higher at 2.82 soles ($1.09).\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Monday to buy $130 million at an average of PEN2.5836 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase U.S. dollars on a regular basis, whether the sol is appreciating or depreciating, in an attempt to reverse an ongoing appreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought more than $10.5 billion this year.\par \par \uc2 The sol ended stronger Friday at PEN2.582 per dollar, compared with PEN2.586 in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has strengthened 4.26% against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 -Write to Ryan Dube at ryan.dube@dowjones.com [ 10-15-12 1615ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020121015e8af000qg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
