\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Trade Minister: Sol Strength a Concern for Exporters\b0\par\par\uc2 484 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2012\par 20:40\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 --Trade minister says stronger sol hurting export revenue\par \par \uc2 --Peru's sol has strengthened more than 6% in last 12 months\par \par \uc2 --Economists expect sol to continue strengthening\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Robert Kozak and Ryan Dube \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 LIMA, Peru--The ongoing appreciation of the sol is causing concerns for the government by cutting into the revenue of Peru's exporters, a high-level government official said Thursday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Trade and Tourism Minister Jose Luis Silva said in a meeting with \f28 \uc2 \f2 the Foreign Press Association\f28 \uc2 \f2  of Peru that the government has to take a broad, multisector view of the sol's gains. He didn't, however, mention any new government measures.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The sol has gained 3.8% so far this year against the greenback, despite \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Central Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Peru\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to purchase more than $10 billion this year.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We are concerned that the exchange rate could strengthen more, and that this would continue to affect revenues for exporters," Mr. Silva said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Peru's sol ended Wednesday at PEN2.595 per U.S. dollar, 6.4% stronger than 12 months earlier.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Economists continue to forecast a strong sol.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The average exchange rate at the end of year will be PEN2.58 per dollar," said Elmer Cuba, managing partner with consultant Macroconsult, adding that the sol could end 2013 at PEN2.55 per dollar or stronger, depending in good part on monetary-policy decisions in the United States.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Peru\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  recently outlined a new \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  plan in which it will buy dollars whether the sol is appreciating or depreciating in order to introduce some uncertainty in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will continue trading with very little volatility given active \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . We remain neutral on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," BofA Merrill Lynch Global Research said in a report.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Peru's economy is heavily dependant on exports, especially of minerals such as gold, copper, zinc and silver.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 At the same meeting, Trade Minister Silva said Peru is expected to end this year with a trade surplus, although the trade balance will be weakened by a decline in the prices for minerals, expected to be overcome to some extent by rising export volumes.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "With its high levels of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (at $59.8 billion, or 18 months of imports), and still comfortable initial current account deficit of only 1.9% and fiscal surplus of 0.9% of GDP as of 2011, Peru has room to withstand some deterioration of its external balance without provoking a sudden adjustment," BofA Merrill Lynch Global Research said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Yet the fact that macro policies are conflicting with the pursuit of external balance seems worthy of concern, particularly as policy makers are not conveying awareness of this inconsistency," it added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Robert Kozak at robert.kozak@dowjones.com and Ryan Dube at ryan.dube@dowjones.com [ 09-27-12 1440ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020120927e89r000gb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
