\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Governor:  \highlight22\uc2 FX Interventions \highlight\uc2  Aim at Reducing Volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 By Cynthia Lin   \par \uc2 522 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 2012\par 16:24\par \uc2 Dow Jones Emerging Markets Report\par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK--Routine \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is aimed at reducing volatility in the exchange rate, not a commitment to guiding the Peruvian sol in a specific direction, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's president said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 At an annual investment forum in New York, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Julio Velarde said the bank's efforts, along with Peru's "solid" fiscal position, have helped to stabilize the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased more than $10 billion through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , actions that effectively rein in the strength of the sol. The latest move came Tuesday, with a $60 million purchase of U.S. dollars at an average rate of PEN2.5962 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The greenback has weakened 3.8% against the Peruvian sol since the beginning of the year.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Velarde explained Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has left its policy rate unchanged at 4.25% since May 2011 as he believes the economy is growing in line with its potential. "We've been keeping the same rate because we don't see much change in that scenario," he said, adding that Peru's inflation has been steady around the bank's 3% upper target and is among the lowest within Latin America.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  increased its forecast for growth in gross domestic product for 2012 to 6% from a previous forecast of 5.8%. The governor said Wednesday he sees growth accelerating to 6.3% in 2014.\par \par \uc2 Demand from a growing middle class is seen driving this growth, as well as a push in exports beyond Peru's core commodity sector. Mr. Velarde said "non-traditional" exports have nearly tripled in the past decade. Meanwhile, the country's demographics continue to improve.\par \par \uc2 "Only China can compete with us in the reduction of poverty," Mr. Velarde said, noting that the poverty rate has fallen to 28% last year from 55% in 2001.\par \par \uc2 Mid-August, Moody's Investors Service upgraded its ratings on Peru to Baa2, citing the South American country's robust economic growth and sound fiscal performance. Mr. Velarde expects the government to post a fiscal surplus of 1.5% this year.\par \par \uc2 As a byproduct of strong growth, Mr. Velarde said credit has been expanding. Banks are a "main source of financing" in Peru, he said, which is one reason why the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has moved to tighten reserve requirements.\par \par \uc2 It increased the average reserve requirements in domestic and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by 0.5 of a percentage point earlier this month. The average requirement for banking sector companies in June was 16% in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while it was 39.8% for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Credit continues growing, maybe even more than what we like," Mr. Velarde said. "But it's also a sign of our dynamics as we're growing in pretty good fashion."\par \par \uc2 --Robert Kozak contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Cynthia Lin at cynthia.lin@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Subscribe to WSJ: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires}}}\uc2  [ 26-09-12 1424GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020120926e89q0000n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
