\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Weakens a Bit\b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 September 2012\par 22:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA, Peru--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Tuesday, dragged down by a decline in some key blue chip mining companies.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's General Index fell 0.2% to end at 21,747.83.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.03% lower at 31,952.67.\par \par \uc2 Silver and lead miner \uc2 Volcan Compania Minera\uc2  SAA (VOLCABC1.VL) fell 0.7% to end at 2.93 soles. ($1.12).\par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BUENAVC1.Vl) fell 1.4% to end at PEN100.\par \par \uc2 Going the other way was financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 ., (BAP) which rose 0.8% to end at $125.80. It owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the \uc2 Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday to buy $60 million at an average of PEN2.5962 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has started to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase U.S. dollars on a regular basis, whether the sol is appreciating or depreciating, in order to in part reverse an ongoing appreciation trend in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 On Monday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase $100 million.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased more than $10 billion so far this year with its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the sol closed slightly weaker at PEN2.598 per dollar compared to PEN2.597 per dollar in the previous trading session.\par \par \uc2 Write to Robert Kozak at robert.kozak@dowjones.com [ 09-25-12 1634ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 27   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020120925e89p0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
