\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Changes  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Approach to Buying Dollars\b0\par\par\uc2 491 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2012\par 23:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  changes approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 --Aims to increase uncertainty in exchange market\par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may purchase dollars even if sol is weakening\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Robert Kozak \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 LIMA, Peru---The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Central Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Peru\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has changed its approach to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to buy U.S. dollars, aiming to make it less of a one-way bet.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may now buy a fixed amount of dollars regardless of whether the dollar is depreciating against the sol, a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spokesman said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The central back has purchased about $10 billion so far this year, mainly by buying varying amounts in each trading session depending on the appreciation pressures on the sol, aiming to reduce volatility.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On Monday, for example, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  purchased $40 million, and the sol closed slightly weaker at PEN2.603 to the dollar compared with PEN2.595 on Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Despite the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  that have helped drive up \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Peru\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's net international reserves to a record $60 billion so far this year, the sol has appreciated by 3.5% against the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Peru's bustling economy--gross domestic product expanded by 7.2% in July--and strong debt ratings, among other factors, have helped boost inflows of capital.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's aim now is in part to add some uncertainty for those taking out dollar-denominated loans for things like cars or houses, trying to ensure that there is no excessive debt burden in dollars that could hurt borrowers who earn in soles, should the dollar appreciate sharply against the sol.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "I think it is an error for those who earn in soles to be taking out loans in dollars," \f28 \uc2 \f2 Central Reserve Bank of Peru\f28 \uc2 \f2  President Julio Velarde said at a news conference late last week.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Before, the sentiment that some [market participants] had is that when it [the sol] starts to depreciate, we stopped buying," he said, adding that, "If we are buying the same amount it will lead to some volatility. We are going to see how it works."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Both the U.S. dollar and the Peruvian sol are legal tender in Peru and are widely used. Most real-estate purchases are made in dollars.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Velarde added that the office of the Superintendent of Banking, Insurance and AFPs is seeking to turn around the trend of having more and more loans being made in dollars in Peru.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "They are trying to establish some additional provisions and to increase risks in mortgage loans in dollars, and will do the same with vehicle loans afterwards. It is a process," Mr. Velarde said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Vehicle loans rose 22% in July over the same month last year, with 73% denominated in dollars, a 9-percentage-point increase in dollar-denominated loans over the same month a year earlier.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Ryan Dube contributed to this article.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Robert Kozak at robert.kozak@dowjones.com [ 09-17-12 1741ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020120917e89h000pu\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Peru near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pa